%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dataweave-formats-yaml (言語ガイド)
doc と相違 (表記のみ: 引用符・括弧・書式の違いで、値は同じ)
doc の Output:
  {
    "american": [
      "Boston Red Sox",
      "Detroit Tigers",
      "New York Yankees"
    ],
    "national": [
      "New York Mets",
      "Chicago Cubs",
      "Atlanta Braves"
    ]
  }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/dw
---
payload
%%% input payload application/yaml
american:
  - Boston Red Sox
  - Detroit Tigers
  - New York Yankees
national:
  - New York Mets
  - Chicago Cubs
  - Atlanta Braves
%%% output application/dw
{
  american: [
    "Boston Red Sox", 
    "Detroit Tigers", 
    "New York Yankees"
  ],
  national: [
    "New York Mets", 
    "Chicago Cubs", 
    "Atlanta Braves"
  ]
} as Object {encoding: "UTF-8", mediaType: "application/yaml"}
